{"trace_id": "2ecf4d668065", "at": "2026-10-19T23:49:01.509362+00:00", "question": "What does ERR-7215 mean?", "answer": "ERR-7215 means the customer name on the account does not match the name registered against the VAT ID. The documented fix is to update the legal entity name on the account to match the registration exactly, then revalidate. [HC-4005-structured-003]", "runner": "agent", "refused": false, "chunk_ids": ["HC-4005-structured-003"], "citations": ["HC-4005-structured-003"], "cache_hit": false, "cache_source": "", "ms": 22217.0, "input_tokens": 2031, "output_tokens": 166, "total_tokens": 2197, "cost": 0.00040425, "llm_calls": 2, "spans": [{"name": "toolbox:connect", "ms": 13582.0, "input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 0, "cost": 0.0, "detail": "5 tool(s)", "ok": true}, {"name": "agent:step 1", "ms": 3709.0, "input_tokens": 921, "output_tokens": 56, "cost": 0.00017175, "detail": "step 1", "ok": true}, {"name": "tool:lookup_error_code", "ms": 4.6, "input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 0, "cost": 0.0, "detail": "1 chunk(s)", "ok": true}, {"name": "agent:step 2", "ms": 3079.0, "input_tokens": 1110, "output_tokens": 110, "cost": 0.0002325, "detail": "step 2", "ok": true}, {"name": "tool:finish", "ms": 0.0, "input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 0, "cost": 0.0, "detail": "0 chunk(s)", "ok": true}], "config": {"runner": "agent", "model": "poolside/laguna-s-2.1:free", "temperature": 0.0, "prompt_sha": "4a4b6fc6a1a4e1af", "corpus_sha": "b5eed06a26dba4e3", "strategy": "structured", "retrieval_mode": "hybrid", "k": 3}, "error": null}
{"trace_id": "afe85642fd4f", "at": "2026-10-19T23:49:47.513910+00:00", "question": "Customer wants a refund but their card token was dropped in the migration. Can I refund to the card?", "answer": "No, you cannot refund to the card. If the card token was dropped during migration, the refund cannot be returned to the card and must be issued as account credit instead. Agents can issue account credit up to 250 in account currency without approval. [HC-4003-structured-006]", "runner": "agent", "refused": false, "chunk_ids": ["HC-4003-structured-006", "HC-4003-structured-001", "HC-4003-structured-004"], "citations": ["HC-4003-structured-006"], "cache_hit": false, "cache_source": "", "ms": 23456.9, "input_tokens": 2505, "output_tokens": 190, "total_tokens": 2695, "cost": 0.00048975, "llm_calls": 2, "spans": [{"name": "toolbox:connect", "ms": 13338.8, "input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 0, "cost": 0.0, "detail": "5 tool(s)", "ok": true}, {"name": "agent:step 1", "ms": 4440.1, "input_tokens": 932, "output_tokens": 63, "cost": 0.0001776, "detail": "step 1", "ok": true}, {"name": "tool:search_help_centre", "ms": 31.6, "input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 0, "cost": 0.0, "detail": "3 chunk(s)", "ok": true}, {"name": "agent:step 2", "ms": 3825.7, "input_tokens": 1573, "output_tokens": 127, "cost": 0.00031215, "detail": "step 2", "ok": true}, {"name": "tool:finish", "ms": 0.0, "input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 0, "cost": 0.0, "detail": "0 chunk(s)", "ok": true}], "config": {"runner": "agent", "model": "poolside/laguna-s-2.1:free", "temperature": 0.0, "prompt_sha": "4a4b6fc6a1a4e1af", "corpus_sha": "b5eed06a26dba4e3", "strategy": "structured", "retrieval_mode": "hybrid", "k": 3}, "error": null}
{"trace_id": "ec2301439d19", "at": "2026-10-19T23:50:36.450141+00:00", "question": "Customer hit ERR-4044 on an invoice. What do I do?", "answer": "ERR-4044 means the invoice total went negative because an imported credit note exceeded the invoice value. The fix is to convert the remainder to account credit using Apply as Credit; do not issue a refund for the difference. [HC-4002-structured-005]", "runner": "agent", "refused": false, "chunk_ids": ["HC-4002-structured-005"], "citations": ["HC-4002-structured-005"], "cache_hit": false, "cache_source": "", "ms": 28693.1, "input_tokens": 3247, "output_tokens": 240, "total_tokens": 3487, "cost": 0.00063105, "llm_calls": 3, "spans": [{"name": "toolbox:connect", "ms": 13363.4, "input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 0, "cost": 0.0, "detail": "5 tool(s)", "ok": true}, {"name": "agent:step 1", "ms": 6168.5, "input_tokens": 928, "output_tokens": 57, "cost": 0.0001734, "detail": "step 1", "ok": true}, {"name": "tool:lookup_error_code", "ms": 4.6, "input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 0, "cost": 0.0, "detail": "1 chunk(s)", "ok": true}, {"name": "agent:step 2", "ms": 3823.3, "input_tokens": 1118, "output_tokens": 67, "cost": 0.0002079, "detail": "step 2", "ok": true}, {"name": "tool:find_similar_tickets", "ms": 1.9, "input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 0, "cost": 0.0, "detail": "0 chunk(s)", "ok": true}, {"name": "agent:step 3", "ms": 3475.9, "input_tokens": 1201, "output_tokens": 116, "cost": 0.00024975, "detail": "step 3", "ok": true}, {"name": "tool:finish", "ms": 0.0, "input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 0, "cost": 0.0, "detail": "0 chunk(s)", "ok": true}], "config": {"runner": "agent", "model": "poolside/laguna-s-2.1:free", "temperature": 0.0, "prompt_sha": "4a4b6fc6a1a4e1af", "corpus_sha": "b5eed06a26dba4e3", "strategy": "structured", "retrieval_mode": "hybrid", "k": 3}, "error": null}
